# TabChannel: сообщение о несинхронизированных каналах.
^(?:\[TabChannel\]\s*)?(?:TabChannel\s+)?tabs unavailable: server did not sync channels\.
^(?:\[TabChannel\]\s*)?On Youer/NeoForge, put the NeoForge TabChannel jar in server/mods
^(?:\[TabChannel\]\s*)?Fabric client = stream chat OK; channels need NeoForge client \+ server\.
